  first | exact @GlobalTheory.PolFan.StarCells.isStarOf_of_clauses | exact GlobalTheory.PolFan.StarCells.isStarOf_of_clauses | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.PolFan.StarCells.isStarOf_of_clauses <;> assumption)
